{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01240",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.72,
      "end_seconds": 5.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Actually, hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.82,
      "end_seconds": 10.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Alright, not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.15,
      "end_seconds": 19.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Yeah, it's pain on the outside of my elbow. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.99,
      "end_seconds": 22.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.68,
      "end_seconds": 26.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "It's been going on for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.4,
      "end_seconds": 38.99,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.83,
      "end_seconds": 48.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "text": "Honestly, once or twice a day. Only rest, and it's not much. I notice it more with gripping."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.04,
      "end_seconds": 53.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.6,
      "end_seconds": 60.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a weaker grip as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.3,
      "end_seconds": 65.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.3,
      "end_seconds": 67.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Moderate, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.91,
      "end_seconds": 71.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.95,
      "end_seconds": 74.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.08,
      "end_seconds": 96.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.14,
      "end_seconds": 100.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "I've had anxiety, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.54,
      "end_seconds": 111.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Okay, I can see anxiety in your file as well. Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.16,
      "end_seconds": 113.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.46,
      "end_seconds": 119.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.53,
      "end_seconds": 133.53,
      "duration_seconds": 12.0,
      "text": "Escitalopram. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety. Ibuprofen gel. I take it three times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.72,
      "end_seconds": 150.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.15,
      "end_seconds": 154.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.25,
      "end_seconds": 157.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.22,
      "end_seconds": 162.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.83,
      "end_seconds": 166.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.29,
      "end_seconds": 171.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.06,
      "end_seconds": 184.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "So, is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.43,
      "end_seconds": 188.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "My cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.15,
      "end_seconds": 192.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "And what about neck pain, swelling or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.31,
      "end_seconds": 198.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "No neck pain, swelling or numbness, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.74,
      "end_seconds": 202.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "So, any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.82,
      "end_seconds": 211.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "hmm, no, my breathing's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.21,
      "end_seconds": 215.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.88,
      "end_seconds": 217.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.99,
      "end_seconds": 221.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.31,
      "end_seconds": 237.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.1,
      "end_seconds": 267.52,
      "duration_seconds": 14.42,
      "text": "okay: pulse 67, temperature is 36.7 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air, height 151 centimetres, blood pressure 113 over 73, BMI works out to 39.9, weight 91 kilos"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.08,
      "end_seconds": 271.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Is that alright, you know, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.71,
      "end_seconds": 275.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.93,
      "end_seconds": 280.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.0,
      "end_seconds": 283.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.39,
      "end_seconds": 309.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "It's tender over the bony point on the outside, and it hurts when I resist your wrist going up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.72,
      "end_seconds": 320.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check. So where does that leave us? My working impression is tennis elbow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.34,
      "end_seconds": 349.93,
      "duration_seconds": 15.59,
      "text": "Rest it, use a forearm strap and do the stretches I'll show you. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.47,
      "end_seconds": 352.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "that's fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.6,
      "end_seconds": 362.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "See me again if it is not better in six weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.45,
      "end_seconds": 367.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.49,
      "end_seconds": 370.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}